DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:Popcorn Fundraiser
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:Holiday popcorn\, cookies and treats shipped to your door. 50% 
 of sales go to Company teams.\n\nHow to order or sell\n• Visit Poppin Po
 pcorn and order online\n• Company dancers: create a seller account and s
 hare your link. Your sales go toward your own competition fees\n• Last d
 ay: Sunday\, Nov 22\n\nStudio calendar: https://leighagrimm-web.github.io/
 datj-concept/families.html#calendar
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cal-wcb@danceandallthatjazz.com
DTSTAMP:20261123T025015Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261114T161500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261114T171500
SUMMARY:Windy City Bulls halftime performance (ages 7+)
LOCATION:NOW Arena\, Hoffman Estates
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, Nov 14 · Call time 4:15 PM · Game 5:00 PM\nDancers
  ages 7+ perform at halftime. Breakers and Hip Hop dancers are part of the
  routine too. $30 covers four rehearsals and the game T-shirt.\n\nRehearsa
 ls\n• Sundays 2:30–4:00 PM: Oct 11\, Oct 18\, Nov 1\, Nov 8\n• Last 
 rehearsal Nov 8: arrive 2:15 PM\n• Know your ripple counts and formation
  before game day\n\nWhat to wear\n• WCB performance T-shirt over a black
  leotard\, tied in the back\n• Solid black\, tight-fitting shorts\n• H
 air slicked back in a ponytail with a middle part\n• Light makeup\n\nSho
 es\n• Petite Company: tan jazz shoes\n• Intermediate\, Junior\, Teen a
 nd Senior Company: turners\n• Hip Hop Company: gym shoes\n• Not on Com
 pany? Ask the front desk\n\nTickets\n• Every performing dancer needs a g
 ame ticket too\n• Buy tickets early\n\nStudio calendar: https://leighagr
 imm-web.github.io/datj-concept/families.html#calendar
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cal-obs@danceandallthatjazz.com
DTSTAMP:20261123T025015Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:Class Observation & Dance Family Appreciation Week
LOCATION:At the studio
DESCRIPTION:Watch your dancer’s class from the lobby\, and stop for coffe
 e\, tea\, hot chocolate and treats as a thank-you to dance families.\n\nOb
 servation guidelines\n• Wait outside until all students are on the dance
  floor. Miss Yessica or Miss Lisa will bring you in\n• Silence phones an
 d keep noise down\n• Don’t open the door to the dance floor\n• No ea
 ting in the lobby\n• No waving or talking through the glass\n• Studio 
 C: sit to the side\, shoes off\, no talking\n\nStudio calendar: https://le
 ighagrimm-web.github.io/datj-concept/families.html#calendar
END:VEVENT
